# Managed Repos — one absolute path per line.
#
# Tilde (~) and inline trailing comments are supported.
# Blank lines and `# …` comments ignored.
#
# Example layout:
#
#   ~/code/my-frontend
#   ~/code/my-api
#   ~/code/my-mobile-app              # PWA experiment
#   /Users/me/projects/legacy-system  # absolute path also OK
#
# After editing this file:
#   1. Run ./scripts/init_ai.sh on each new repo to install the AI/ folder
#   2. Run ./scripts/update_all.sh to propagate framework updates
#   3. Run ./scripts/health_check.sh to verify compliance
#
# This .example file is the fork-ready template.
# Copy to `managed_repos.txt` and add your own paths.
